// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO39 - internal power-control line (RGB_PWR/
// LDO2), not general-purpose.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard BOOT pushbutton
// (Unexpected Maker Help docs: hold BOOT then press RESET to enter flash
// mode, pulling GPIO0 low), matching the same pattern already confirmed
// on sibling board um_pros3.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO13 tagged "led_high" - confirmed active-high onboard
// blue status LED (LED_BUILTIN), per UM esp32s3-arduino-helper library
// (UMS3.h setBlueLED(): digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, on)) and espboards.dev
// FeatherS3 pinout listing "LED_BUILTIN LED" on GPIO13.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO40 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard WS2812
// addressable RGB LED data pin (RGB_DATA), per Unexpected Maker FeatherS3
// product page (esp32s3.com/feathers3.html, "1515 Neopixel") and
// espboards.dev pinout listing "RGB_DATA" on GPIO40; power is gated by
// GPIO39 (RGB_PWR/LDO2), already excluded above.
